

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. TESTING OVERVIEW

Testing is performed to verify the functionality and reliability of the LegalEase system across different user inputs and document generation scenarios.

2. TESTING OBJECTIVES

• Verify user input handling.
• Check legal document generation.
• Validate the Gemini AI integration.
• Check document formatting and export.
• Test different input combinations and edge cases.

3. TEST CASES

Test Case 1
Input: Employment contract details
Expected Result: A structured employment contract should be generated.

Test Case 2
Input: NDA details
Expected Result: A structured Non-Disclosure Agreement should be generated.

Test Case 3
Input: Residential lease details
Expected Result: A formatted residential lease agreement should be generated.

4. FUNCTIONAL TESTING

The system is tested from user input through AI generation and final document output to verify that each stage works correctly.

5. OUTPUT TESTING

The generated document is checked for:

• Proper structure
• Required sections
• Correct formatting
• Editable content
• DOCX, PDF and HTML output

6. API TESTING

The FastAPI endpoints and Gemini API integration are tested with different input combinations to verify successful document generation.

7. TESTING RESULT

Testing helps verify the end-to-end functionality of the LegalEase workflow and identify issues related to inputs, AI generation, formatting and API communication.

8. CONCLUSION

The testing and QA stage ensures that the LegalEase system is checked across diverse inputs and edge cases before deployment.
